  "keyFeatures": [
    "Clock-driven spiking neural network simulation",
    "Expressive equation-based model definition using strings",
    "Physical units system with automatic dimensional analysis",
    "Multiple code generation targets: Python (numpy), Cython, and C++ standalone",
    "Flexible synapse models with STDP and plasticity rules",
    "Multicompartmental neuron modeling with SpatialNeuron",
    "Built-in monitors for spikes, state variables, and population rates",
    "Magic network system for automatic object collection",
    "Rich input stimulus options: Poisson groups, spike generators, timed arrays",
    "GSL integration for advanced numerical ODE methods",
    "Customizable preferences and logging system",
    "Custom event system beyond standard spike events"
  ],
